  CONFIRMED (`word_in_generators_of_mem_closure`) by `Subgroup.closure_induction`;
  symmetry `hSsymm` is load-bearing in the inverse case.
HYPOTHESIS (H2): Generation gives walk-connectivity of the Cayley graph.
